# Exceptions: the committed, seeded demo databases are the canonical data
# source and must be present on a fresh clone (the specialist agents resolve
# to repo-wide data/demo.db). Their -wal/-shm sidecars remain ignored above.
!data/demo.db
!data/business.db

# stray env file (belt-and-suspenders)
/env
